        <mxCell id="c62" value="Manufactured units shipped" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="180" y="494" width="190" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c63" value="" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDEDEC;strokeColor=#B03A2E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="390" y="497" width="14" height="14" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c64" value="Months of the stock build: completed above shipped" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="494" width="360" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c65" value="&lt;i&gt;From February to June the plant completed 12,054 more units than it shipped, an inventory build consistent with the little indirect time from February to May, 97, 0, 80 and 70 hours against 28,427 direct (test T4), although June already had 2,239. A plausible explanation, to confirm with the production schedules. In July completions (3,201) fell below shipments (3,311) and the share of direct time recorded after its operation ended rose from 0.07 in June to 0.41, the first month above a quarter.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="522" width="860" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
